Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.03,0:00:27.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.69,0:00:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.59,0:00:40.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.99,0:00:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.65,0:00:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.81,0:00:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.95,0:00:55.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.75,0:00:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.21,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.67,0:01:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.97,0:01:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonderland.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.91,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.25,0:01:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.65,0:01:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.01,0:01:32.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:42.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:54.78,0:02:01.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(981,0)\3c&H1E1E1E&\c&H1E1E1E&\bord2.3\1a&HFF&\t(939,981,\1a&H00&)}Dorry and Brogy
Dialogue: 2,0:01:54.78,0:02:01.70,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(981,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}Dorry and Brogy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:10.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.37,0:02:13.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.49,0:02:54.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.13,0:03:05.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.04,0:03:07.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he blocked that hit with his helmet!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.41,0:03:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.32,0:03:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A couple of inches left to ride\Nand it would've killed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:28.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What an incredible fight, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:32.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every one of those attacks\Nis aimed at some vital spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.29,0:03:34.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one slip from either\Nof them and that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:38.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These guys have really been\Nfighting to the death for 100 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.85,0:03:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's got to get old.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:42.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our chance to get away. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.45,0:03:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.51,0:04:01.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.83,0:04:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:06.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fight so seriously, and\Nthey don't even know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.53,0:04:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight's getting really annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:22.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.91,0:04:26.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is an example of a real\Nbattle between real men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.67,0:04:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.63,0:04:31.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe an analogy will help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.49,0:04:35.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as if they have each planted a flag\Nin their hearts that says, I am a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.05,0:04:40.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This flag is more important than\Nanything, more than their lives even.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.05,0:04:44.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can never allow the flag\Nto be destroyed by someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.41,0:04:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why they both continue\Nthis fight for a hundred years.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.07,0:04:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see it now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.79,0:04:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a proud duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A legendary fight between\Ntwo dedicated warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.87,0:05:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.15,0:05:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That warrior stuff doesn't really\Ninterest me in the slightest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.83,0:05:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I'm still watching this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.19,0:05:10.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is my ultimate goal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.73,0:05:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.85,0:05:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be a brave warrior\Nlike each of these titans.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.21,0:05:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really though, someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.33,0:05:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will be a proud warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:26.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what you're saying then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that you want to be a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.35,0:05:31.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.26,0:05:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't listened to a\Nsingle word I've said, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.29,0:05:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp Isn't there something\Nthat you're supposed to be watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.91,0:05:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there's a village full\Nof warriors like these two,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.65,0:05:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I really want to go there someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.01,0:06:06.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say that we're both\Nstarting to get homesick here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, Dorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.84,0:06:12.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I intend to\Nwin this duel of ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to beat you\Nand go home to Elbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.85,0:06:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got that, Brogy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.75,0:06:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,73,466 duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.55,0:06:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,73,466 duels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.69,0:07:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you're done, get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.25,0:07:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I can handle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.81,0:07:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,3,000 telegram press!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Mr. Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.03,0:07:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed by the decor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.67,0:07:40.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have a talent for turning even the\Nmost savage environment into a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I admire you, which is why I feel\Ncompelled to remind both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This mission belongs to\Nme and Miss Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.31,0:07:49.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, we won't slip\Nup like we did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.63,0:07:50.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slip up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.54,0:07:54.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not why I'm here,\NMr. Five, Miss Valentine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.45,0:07:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The simple fact of the\Nmatter is you are both weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.09,0:08:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't waste your energy pouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.19,0:08:03.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:04.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.93,0:08:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd like to thank you both for affording\Nme an excuse to come to this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.81,0:08:11.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll enjoy the opportunity to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.73,0:08:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,some truly big game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.83,0:08:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory the Blue Ogre and Brogy the Red\NOgre are the giant warrior pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.95,0:08:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone's heard of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.15,0:08:23.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's ancient legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.21,0:08:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, this poster's over 100 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.57,0:08:28.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, those two legends are alive\Nand well on this very island,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.01,0:08:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,battling over a century now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.05,0:08:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back when that poster was new,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.49,0:08:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the bounty on their heads was\N100 million berries apiece,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.43,0:08:37.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,200 million for the both of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.43,0:08:39.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,200 million berries is an impressive sum.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.89,0:08:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that doesn't change the\Nfact that they're giants
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a wise saying\Nsuperior criminals are those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.97,0:08:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who execute their crimes\Nusing superior intellect
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.51,0:08:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all you have to do is follow\Nmy precise instructions
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.13,0:08:53.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with a smidgen of forethought\Nand perseverance you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.59,0:08:56.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can find the solution to\Neven the most gargantuan of?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.87,0:09:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,...of obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.07,0:09:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Dory, a couple of guests\Nof mine gave me some alcohol.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.03,0:09:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drinks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.07,0:09:27.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been a long while.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.79,0:09:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Brogy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.79,0:09:38.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:41.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So Bragi's guests are\Nfriends of yours, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw a goofy-looking guy with\Na long nose and a woman there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.99,0:09:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Usopp and Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:48.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They said they weren't even\Ngonna get off the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.65,0:09:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess they wanted to have\Nan adventure after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.45,0:09:53.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're your friends,\Nthen I guess I can thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.79,0:09:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,too, for these yummy refreshments.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.21,0:10:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Dory, tell us, does it really take a\Nyear for the log to reset on this island?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.39,0:10:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You notice all the mounds of human\Nskeletons that are lying around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.83,0:10:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it's hard not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.09,0:10:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people who come to this island tend\Nto die before their logs are reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.11,0:10:15.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some become dinosaur food.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.09,0:10:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some die from heat or\Nthirst or starvation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Others are killed because\Nthey stupidly attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.23,0:10:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the case, they\Nall die here somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:29.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An entire year on this island\Njust seems to be too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.25,0:10:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So far, no humans have been able\Nto survive here for the full year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.81,0:10:34.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.43,0:10:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if we could manage\Nto last here for a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.27,0:10:39.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who knows what could happen by then?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.19,0:10:40.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My country could be lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:42.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.03,0:10:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus, I get bored here after a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.51,0:10:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything else\Nwe can do about it, old man?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:49.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We do have an eternal pose here,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:54.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but its magnetic link is to\Nour home village, Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.33,0:10:55.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Basically,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that eternal pose is\Nwhat Broggy and I have
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.89,0:10:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,been fighting for with\Nour duels this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.01,0:11:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, you can try\Nto take it by force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.87,0:11:04.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.51,0:11:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elbaf isn't the place that\Nwe're trying to get to.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.89,0:11:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We just want to get to the island\Nthat's right after this one, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.47,0:11:11.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.87,0:11:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We must stay on the route that's\Ngoing to lead us to my home,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.89,0:11:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or else there's no point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.61,0:11:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.95,0:11:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you can try\Nsailing forward randomly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.49,0:11:23.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may get there eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.57,0:11:24.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're real lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.75,0:11:33.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.43,0:11:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may actually get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.25,0:11:43.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone did leave the island\Nonce before his log was reset.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.95,0:11:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.45,0:11:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How should I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.05,0:11:52.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure he was able to\Nget to the next island.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what these two idiots\Nare laughing about at a time like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.57,0:12:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brave warrior of the seas, you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.21,0:12:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.77,0:12:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.59,0:12:25.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I really want is to be\Nlike the two of you someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.11,0:12:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:27.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to be a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.31,0:12:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.37,0:12:30.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what I mean!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.61,0:12:33.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be a great warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.59,0:12:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be brave and proud like\Nyou and the others from Elbath.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.11,0:12:41.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, in Elbath, even though our\Nlifespans are longer than yours are,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we still think about how we will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.33,0:12:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We know everything we have and everything\Nwe are will one day cease to exist,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,like everything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.37,0:13:00.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it is worth it to die a true warrior\Nof Elbaph, without sacrificing your pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.29,0:13:02.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is what we call dying with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.81,0:13:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To die such a great death would\Nbe an everlasting treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's what we seek in Elbaph.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.31,0:13:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So pride is your treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:12.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.79,0:13:14.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided to learn from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.69,0:13:16.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From now on, I'll call you Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.99,0:13:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, giant guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.29,0:13:41.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.89,0:13:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did it explode?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:46.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the same alcohol\Nwe had with us on the ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.51,0:13:52.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wasn't it? It exploded in his stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.11,0:13:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,other giant must have booby-trapped it
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.45,0:13:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hold it were you even watching them they
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:14:01.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight their duels honorably\Nno way he'd do that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.71,0:14:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all right then who did do it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.71,0:14:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You strangers!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.29,0:14:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That wasn't Brogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.79,0:14:15.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.71,0:14:19.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No warrior of Elbaf would dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.47,0:14:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, who else is there to\Nsuspect on this island then?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.35,0:14:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.21,0:14:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.71,0:14:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no use talking to him right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.87,0:14:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt running would do us any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on to this! Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.03,0:14:36.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:37.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,fight Dory?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.35,0:14:42.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.27,0:14:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have to settle this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.83,0:14:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't do it, you guys! Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:54.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory, please just listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.73,0:14:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't know anything about the\Nexplosives in the barrels, I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.97,0:14:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.11,0:15:02.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be in any shape to\Nfight right now, so please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.17,0:15:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.08,0:15:09.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why should I believe you liars?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.63,0:15:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then, Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.89,0:15:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GUNGUNFUL!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.35,0:15:51.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GUNGUNFUL!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.45,0:15:53.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.85,0:15:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brock!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.09,0:16:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.99,0:16:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has some power from\None of the devil fruits.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.85,0:16:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems I underestimated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:17:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy are you all right how is he he
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.37,0:17:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should be okay i guess you were right
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.73,0:17:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,about fighting He's certainly a lot
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.67,0:17:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,calmer now well i'm not the old guy was
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.15,0:17:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right about one thing anyway The other\Ngiant would never do anything like
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.75,0:17:20.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this but i know that our friends wouldn't\Ndo it either They aren't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.85,0:17:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, then who?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.01,0:17:25.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must be somebody\Nelse on this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.07,0:17:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key to winning any game is to\Nknow your opponent's state of mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.33,0:17:41.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For now we have succeeded\Nin confusing our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.31,0:17:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are no doubt wondering about the\Nmysterious bomb that we delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.01,0:17:47.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And about the identity\Nof their invisible enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.05,0:17:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our first target was the\Nlong-bearded giant Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew, of course, that it would be\Nnearly impossible to finish him off,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.93,0:18:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the damage done to his stomach by\Nthe bomb must have been considerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.39,0:18:01.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.30,0:18:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we can sit here enjoying our tea while\Nrelaxing and wait for the next duel to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.15,0:18:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we stay in the background and let\Nthe giant kill off the injured one?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.43,0:18:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's certainly an indirect method.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again, you have to consider your enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.69,0:18:22.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Warriors like these two operate in\Nmuch the same way as wild boars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.45,0:18:24.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can be intimidating\Nin a head-on fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.43,0:18:27.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but they don't have the brains to think\Nbeyond their immediate circumstance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.03,0:18:30.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why bother going after\Nthem directly when you
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.17,0:18:33.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have the intelligence to\Ndestroy them indirectly?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.69,0:18:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.31,0:18:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:42.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.55,0:18:51.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why can't you just get\Nthe tea yourself, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.31,0:18:52.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Golden Week?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.35,0:18:55.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just what are we supposed\Nto do with the Straw Hat Gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.63,0:18:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Gang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.07,0:19:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're talking about the little\Nbrats who found out the boss's secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.57,0:19:04.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can start by luring\Nthem out one by one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The order doesn't matter, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.61,0:19:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's start with the one\Nclosest to my tea set.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.37,0:19:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a personal motto, you know, and\Nthat is big crimes via cheap tricks.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:20.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are plenty of good ways to\Ndefeat any enemy, all without fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.45,0:19:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's their signal, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's the signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.47,0:19:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really been active today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.11,0:19:40.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're really going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.51,0:19:43.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But your wounds from the\Nlast battle haven't healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.99,0:19:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Dory can't be\Ndoing any better than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.19,0:19:53.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few scratches won't\Ntake me out of a duel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.15,0:19:57.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would sure make me a poor\Nexcuse for a brave warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.01,0:20:05.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, giant guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.13,0:20:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.04,0:20:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't fight, Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.09,0:20:09.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.13,0:20:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll die if you push yourself too hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.47,0:20:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.15,0:20:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Dory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.09,0:20:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will fight for Elbaf's\Npride and die as a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.71,0:20:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.93,0:20:28.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broggy, go and show this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.83,0:20:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to beat him for sure this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.87,0:20:38.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He hasn't got a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.25,0:20:40.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go get him, you great warrior of Elbaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.75,0:20:43.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The mighty Brogy always\Ndefeats his opponent!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can do it, Brogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.53,0:20:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the mightiest warrior in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.93,0:20:50.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can destroy him any day!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.67,0:20:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna crush him!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.11,0:20:53.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, warrior Brogy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.69,0:20:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight like the proud warrior you are, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.33,0:20:56.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broggy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.24,0:20:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does it continue this pointless fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.16,0:20:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you say something\Nlike this is pointless?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.39,0:21:00.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Broggy is a brave warrior,\Njust like I'm gonna be someday!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have no right to\Nsay anything, you idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.87,0:21:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, now we can think about\Ngetting back to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.23,0:21:07.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waiting for a year,\Nthere's no freakin' way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.61,0:21:09.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's completely unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.19,0:21:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get everyone back on\Nthe ship and come up with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.97,0:21:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.21,0:21:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, for one, don't think we stand a\Nchance in a fight against dinosaurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.93,0:21:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cutting through the jungle\Nin order to get back to the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:23.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary won't do us much good\Nif we get killed on the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.39,0:21:24.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,will it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.30,0:21:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened to all that brave warrior of\Nthe sea stuff you've been going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:31.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said that someday I would\Nbe a brave warrior of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.13,0:21:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, even a brave warrior has to have\Nenough sense not to get himself killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.57,0:21:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy's group is at the\Nother giant's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.11,0:21:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should probably head that way first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.53,0:21:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, listen, even if I should\Nlose everything someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.65,0:21:48.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I must face a horribly tragic\Ndeath, alone on a deserted island,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.61,0:21:50.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will proudly say this\Nabout how I have lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.99,0:21:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Captain Usopp and know that I have\Nbeen a great brave warrior of the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.73,0:22:03.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, but for now, do you think you\Ncould just try to be a dependable warrior?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.33,0:22:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.55,0:22:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this rock off me, move this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been over a century.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.57,0:22:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since we started the battle, this duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.37,0:22:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Injured or not, I cannot allow\Nmyself to run away from this fight.?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.87,0:22:39.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To do so would be like running\Nfrom the title of warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.43,0:22:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I was no longer a warrior of Elbath,\Nthen I would no longer know who I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.33,0:22:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I suspected you\Nof causing the explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I now know that this was a judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.57,0:22:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A judgment from Elbaph, the god of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.97,0:23:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't have the god's\Nprotection, and that is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.65,0:23:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.67,0:23:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gods and protection and judgments have\Nnothing to do with what's going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If a god told you to just\Nrun off and die, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.07,0:23:16.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone has interfered with your duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.19,0:23:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And a duel that's been interfered\Nwith isn't a fair fight anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.55,0:23:22.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.55,0:23:24.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:27.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What can you know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.01,0:23:31.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're a human who can't have been living\Non this earth for more than two decades.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.27,0:23:35.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you possibly hope to understand\Nthe ways of the warriors of Elba?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.17,0:23:38.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares about that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.39,0:23:42.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get this damn thing off me! Hey! Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.37,0:23:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.43,0:23:45.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move this rock already! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.59,0:23:46.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:48.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't leave me trapped like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.19,0:23:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dory, how was your drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.17,0:23:59.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit the spot, didn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.03,0:24:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.94,0:24:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It tasted almost godly!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.71,0:24:07.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm glad that you enjoyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.85,0:24:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.73,0:24:31.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move, you stupid rock! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.51,0:24:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just what I mean a great\Nwarrior, this happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.23,0:24:37.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.87,0:24:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand why he's so\Nupset over someone that he just met.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.73,0:24:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He sure doesn't seem much like a hardened\Ncriminal with a bounty on his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.91,0:24:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.03,0:24:49.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who would dare to interfere?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.85,0:24:50.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.35,0:24:54.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.63,0:24:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo is missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.29,0:25:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.77,0:25:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.03,0:25:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tree looks familiar, but it's\Nkind of hard to tell in this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.59,0:25:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I was supposed to take a\Nleft at the tree wrapped in vines.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.61,0:25:18.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Nami, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.45,0:25:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like I got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.03,0:25:22.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you got some\Npretty good timing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.95,0:25:24.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wasn't sure what I was going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.59,0:25:27.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, what are you doing\Nin this area anyway, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.43,0:25:30.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.07,0:25:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, it's another dinosaur!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.13,0:25:43.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.15,0:25:49.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.55,0:25:52.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, is it a relief to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.59,0:25:54.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.15,0:26:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.37,0:26:08.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.23,0:26:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami! Nami! Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.77,0:26:26.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.13,0:26:27.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ZOMBIE!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.37,0:26:39.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is a treasure out there to be found.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.67,0:26:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The odds that you'll\Nfind it are slim to none.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.99,0:26:46.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The world's such a big\Nplace, the oceans are wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.33,0:26:48.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The muck and bone won't help you find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.45,0:26:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give up the task when I'm become?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.67,0:26:53.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.59,0:26:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone tries to be\Nfast from moving home!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.69,0:27:02.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The factor behind the\Nback just keeps us strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.97,0:27:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too bad because we're still\Nselling for what's so fun for ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.81,0:27:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.81,0:27:13.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be foolish chasing\Nimpossible things.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.61,0:27:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I just gotta try!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.17,0:27:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crazier the dream, the\Nmore ambition I'm gonna need.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.65,0:27:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be foolish driving on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.07,0:27:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I know that I just gotta try.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.97,0:27:35.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Far through the sea, the great\Nof paradise, we've got to find.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.65,0:27:40.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't give up. Just keep on trying,\Nand you'll see that you're closer to?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.91,0:27:43.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The horizon of your dreams.

